# ACT 1 · Bus still · POI: mother and child. The child is the only one who can see the ghost.
Child: Mama. Mama, who's that?
Mother: Who, baby?
Child: The see-through lady. By the girl with the backpack.
Mother: [i]Not this again. Imaginary friends were cute last year.[/i]
Mother: There's nobody there, sweetheart. Sit down properly.
Child: She looks sad.
Ghost: [pause=0.4]...Lady?
